Z||000005||falconhulk||11-09-2001||05:42 PM||||What was the HP on that 305?  The Gta's with 350's woould have beat a Fiero.  I have not seen a stock 305 that could out pull a fiero.  Check the stats the 1/4 and 0 to 60 Fiero  wins.  Did you mean GTA with a 350? I think that years 305 TPI topped at 170hp!  The 305 TBI in that time frame was like 205 hp.  When you factor in the wieght its not that much diffrence in power to wieght.<p>[This message has been edited by falconhulk (edited 11-09-2001).]||||reg||1
